  "${@0}^\\circ = {@1}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{180} = \\frac{{@2}}{180}\\pi = {@3}$, teda $k = {@4}$.": "${@0}^\\circ = {@1}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi}{180} = \\frac{{@2}}{180}\\pi = {@3}$, so $k = {@4}$.",
  "$|AB| = \\sqrt{({@0} - {@1})^2 + ({@2} - {@3})^2} = \\sqrt{{@4} + {@5}} = \\sqrt{{@6}}{@7}$.": "$|AB| = \\sqrt{({@0} - {@1})^2 + ({@2} - {@3})^2} = \\sqrt{{@4} + {@5}} = \\sqrt{{@6}}{@7}$.",
  "$|\\Omega| = 6\\cdot 6 = 36$. Priaznivých výsledkov je {@0}{@1}. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{36}{@3}$.": "$|\\Omega| = 6\\cdot 6 = 36$. The number of favourable outcomes is {@0}{@1}. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{36}{@3}$.",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{32}{2} = {@0}$. Priaznivých výberov je {@1}. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{{@3}} = {@4}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{32}{2} = {@0}$. There are {@1} favourable selections. $P = \\frac{{@2}}{{@3}} = {@4}$.",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{2} = {@1}$. Priaznivých dvojíc je {@2}. $P = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}{@5}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{2} = {@1}$. There are {@2} favourable pairs. $P = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}}{@5}$.",
  "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. Priaznivé: vyberieme {@3} z {@4} červených a {@5} z {@6} bielych: $\\binom{{@7}}{{@8}}\\cdot\\binom{{@9}}{{@10}} = {@11}\\cdot {@12} = {@13}$. $P = \\frac{{@14}}{{@15}}{@16}$.": "$|\\Omega| = \\binom{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. Favourable: we choose {@3} of the {@4} red ones and {@5} of the {@6} white ones: $\\binom{{@7}}{{@8}}\\cdot\\binom{{@9}}{{@10}} = {@11}\\cdot {@12} = {@13}$. $P = \\frac{{@14}}{{@15}}{@16}$.",
