  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží medzi ${@2}^\\circ$ a ${@3}^\\circ$, teda v {@4} kvadrante.": "{@0}The angle ${@1}^\\circ$ lies between ${@2}^\\circ$ and ${@3}^\\circ$, i.e. in quadrant {@4}.",
  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží v {@2} kvadrante, kde je {@3} kladný. Hodnota je kladná.": "{@0}The angle ${@1}^\\circ$ lies in quadrant {@2}, where {@3} is positive. The value is positive.",
