  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží v {@2} kvadrante, príslušný ostrý uhol je ${@3}^\\circ$ a {@4} je tu {@5}. Preto ${@6}\\,{@7} = {@8}{@9}\\,{@10}^\\circ = {@11}$.": "{@0}The angle ${@1}^\\circ$ lies in quadrant {@2}, the corresponding acute angle is ${@3}^\\circ$ and {@4} is {@5} here. Therefore ${@6}\\,{@7} = {@8}{@9}\\,{@10}^\\circ = {@11}$.",
