  "Úsečka je určená dvojicou bodov bez ohľadu na poradie: $\\binom{7}{2} = 21$.": "A segment is determined by a pair of points regardless of order: $\\binom{7}{2} = 21$.",
  "Úver ${@0}$ € s úrokovou mierou ${@1}\\,\\%$ p. a. splácame {@2} {@3} rovnakými mesačnými splátkami (prvá splátka mesiac po poskytnutí úveru). Aká je výška mesačnej splátky? {@4}": "We repay a loan of ${@0}$ € at an interest rate of ${@1}\\,\\%$ p.a. over {@2} {@3} in equal monthly instalments (the first instalment a month after the loan is granted). How large is the monthly instalment? {@4}",
